  "Why did Musa follow al-Khidr?": ["Quran 18:66: 'hal attabi'uka 'ala an tu'allimani mimma 'ullimta rushda?' Why did Musa follow al-Khidr?", "To sell him sheep", "To fight him", "To find gold"],
