  "What is Yusha' ibn Nun known for?": ["Bukhari 3401: Musa's young helper, 'fatahu yusha' ibn nun'. Which is his story?", "He spoke with Allah and received the Tawrah.", "He was Ibrahim's nephew and a prophet sent to Sodom.", "He was a prophet who confirmed that Isa would come."],
