  "What is Ilyas known for?": ["Quran 37:123-125: 'a-tad'una ba'lan wa tadharuna ahsanal-khaliqin.' Which is Ilyas's story?", "He is the last messenger Allah sent.", "He explained dreams and became a minister of Egypt.", "He helped his father Ibrahim build the Ka'bah."],
